# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale da
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as [05:00, 10:00).
#
# Bare "morgen" is the noun "morning" (en.wiktionary "morgen", Danish
# noun: "morning"); Den Danske Ordbog "morgen" gives "mandag/søndag
# morgen".  "tomorrow" is the two-word adverb "i morgen"
# (named_day_1.voc).  "morgenen" is also a meridiem marker in
# clock_meridiem_am.voc ("klokken ni om morgenen" == 09:00).
morgenen
morgen
# "tidlig" right after "i morgen" (marker_daypart_after_day.voc).
tidlig
